  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform thin metal plate of mass $10 \\mathrm{~kg}$ with dimensions is shown. The ratio of $\\mathrm{x}$ and $\\mathrm{y}$ coordinates of center of mass of plate in $\\frac{n}{9}$. The value of $n$ is ________\n<img src=\"assets\\qt0011_e3ad0e68d1e1.png\"><br>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{m}_1=\\sigma \\times 5=10 \\mathrm{Kg}$\n<img src=\"assets\\st0011_0de30a7074d4.png\"><br><img src=\"assets\\st0011_68000044dd5e.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{m}_1 \\mathrm{x}_1+\\mathrm{m}_2 \\mathrm{x}_2=\\mathrm{m}_3 \\mathrm{x}_3 \\\\ & 10 \\mathrm{x}_1+2(1.5)=12(1.5) \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x}_1=1.5 \\mathrm{~cm} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{m}_1 \\mathrm{y}_1+\\mathrm{m}_2 \\mathrm{y}_2=\\mathrm{m}_3 \\mathrm{y}_3 \\\\ & 10 \\mathrm{y}_1+2(1.5)=12 \\times 1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{y}_1=0.9 \\mathrm{~cm} \\\\ & \\frac{\\mathrm{x}_1}{\\mathrm{y}_1}=\\frac{1.5}{0.9}=\\frac{15}{9} \\\\ & \\mathrm{n}=15\\end{aligned}$"
  }
